# ONEAG Multi-Platform Application
# Zero environment variables are required for preview or development.
# All affiliate partner integrations (Amazon Creators API, Flipkart Affiliate, Myntra, Meesho)
# are fully optional and remain safely DISABLED / NOT CONFIGURED when credentials are unavailable.
#
# Optional Server-Side Variables (supported by server-side partner configuration layer):
#
# Amazon Associates India (Amazon Creators API only; PA-API 5 is unsupported):
# - AMAZON_ASSOCIATE_TAG
# - AMAZON_CREATORS_CLIENT_ID
# - AMAZON_CREATORS_CLIENT_SECRET
# - AMAZON_CREATORS_CREDENTIAL_VERSION
# - AMAZON_CREATORS_MARKETPLACE (default: "amazon.in")
#
# Flipkart Affiliate Network:
# - FLIPKART_AFFILIATE_ID
# - FLIPKART_AFFILIATE_TOKEN
#
# Myntra Partner Program:
# - Optional provider configuration; keep disabled until an official supported affiliate/API credential path is available.
# - No invented MYNTRA_API_KEY.
#
# Meesho Partner Program:
# - Optional provider configuration; keep disabled until an official supported affiliate/API credential path is available.
# - No invented MEESHO_API_KEY.

# AG Creator (server only; never expose this key through Vite/VITE_ variables)
GEMINI_API_KEY=
# Optional model overrides:
# GEMINI_TEXT_MODEL=gemini-3.8-flash
# GEMINI_IMAGE_MODEL=gemini-3.1-flash-image
# FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=oneag-b9739
